      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.26,
      "end_seconds": 5.19,
      "duration_seconds": 3.93,
      "text": "Actually, sorry I'm a little late, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.25,
      "end_seconds": 11.19,
      "duration_seconds": 4.94,
      "text": "You're alright, take a seat. What can I do for you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 11.82,
      "end_seconds": 18.39,
      "duration_seconds": 6.57,
      "text": "Yeah, it's bloating when I slip up. I don't know what's causing it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 22.15,
      "end_seconds": 26.44,
      "duration_seconds": 4.29,
      "text": "Right, can you tell me when it first started?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 27.08,
      "end_seconds": 30.09,
      "duration_seconds": 3.01,
      "text": "I've had it since yesterday."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 30.81,
      "end_seconds": 35.38,
      "duration_seconds": 4.57,
      "text": "Okay, give me more detail on it, whatever comes to mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 37.05,
      "end_seconds": 54.34,
      "duration_seconds": 17.29,
      "text": "So, about a eight out of ten. I notice it more with gluten. As for mouth ulcers, I honestly can't say when that began. It might have been last month or the month before."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 55.48,
      "end_seconds": 58.33,
      "duration_seconds": 2.85,
      "text": "What's on your current medicine list?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 61.46,
      "end_seconds": 65.21,
      "duration_seconds": 3.75,
      "text": "It's hydrochlorothiazide, 12.5 milligrams, every morning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 66.9,
      "end_seconds": 69.88,
      "duration_seconds": 2.98,
      "text": "Any past operations I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 70.66,
      "end_seconds": 80.7,
      "duration_seconds": 10.04,
      "text": "Sorry, what was I saying, yes, I had my appendix taken out, when I was in my twenties."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 87.92,
      "end_seconds": 91.75,
      "duration_seconds": 3.83,
      "text": "Are there any allergies I should be aware of?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 92.26,
      "end_seconds": 95.78,
      "duration_seconds": 3.52,
      "text": "I don't think I have any, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 97.59,
      "end_seconds": 100.24,
      "duration_seconds": 2.65,
      "text": "Do you have any long-term conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 102.22,
      "end_seconds": 104.92,
      "duration_seconds": 2.7,
      "text": "I have high blood pressure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 105.74,
      "end_seconds": 106.81,
      "duration_seconds": 1.07,
      "text": "Mm, okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 117.14,
      "end_seconds": 118.77,
      "duration_seconds": 1.63,
      "text": "Do you drink alcohol?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 119.53,
      "end_seconds": 123.14,
      "duration_seconds": 3.61,
      "text": "I only drink at family occasions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 124.34,
      "end_seconds": 127.1,
      "duration_seconds": 2.76,
      "text": "Do you follow any particular diet?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 128.79,
      "end_seconds": 132.77,
      "duration_seconds": 3.98,
      "text": "I'm vegetarian and have been for years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 133.38,
      "end_seconds": 134.94,
      "duration_seconds": 1.56,
      "text": "Have you retired yet?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 138.71,
      "end_seconds": 144.23,
      "duration_seconds": 5.52,
      "text": "I retired from the post office two years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 148.66,
      "end_seconds": 151.13,
      "duration_seconds": 2.47,
      "text": "Do you get out much?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 154.08,
      "end_seconds": 158.41,
      "duration_seconds": 4.33,
      "text": "Not much, I mostly stay in these days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 158.99,
      "end_seconds": 163.98,
      "duration_seconds": 4.99,
      "text": "And what about bone pain, diarrhoea, vomiting or weight loss?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 164.69,
      "end_seconds": 167.77,
      "duration_seconds": 3.08,
      "text": "No, none of those at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 168.6,
      "end_seconds": 171.08,
      "duration_seconds": 2.48,
      "text": "And your skin, any changes there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 171.62,
      "end_seconds": 172.7,
      "duration_seconds": 1.08,
      "text": "Skin's normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 174.57,
      "end_seconds": 176.65,
      "duration_seconds": 2.08,
      "text": "Your breathing, any trouble there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 177.45,
      "end_seconds": 182.38,
      "duration_seconds": 4.93,
      "text": "Let me think, no, my breathing's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 187.58,
      "end_seconds": 196.0,
      "duration_seconds": 8.42,
      "text": "Okay, so the vitals from earlier. Heart rate 64, temperature 36.6, respiratory rate 17. Saturation 97 percent, pressure 123 over 70."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 198.27,
      "end_seconds": 199.79,
      "duration_seconds": 1.52,
      "text": "Good, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 201.99,
      "end_seconds": 206.54,
      "duration_seconds": 4.55,
      "text": "Alright, over here please and I'll take a look."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 207.79,
      "end_seconds": 210.62,
      "duration_seconds": 2.83,
      "text": "Stay as you are for a moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 229.44,
      "end_seconds": 235.23,
      "duration_seconds": 5.79,
      "text": "Your tummy is soft and your weight is stable on the scales."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 237.68,
      "end_seconds": 239.43,
      "duration_seconds": 1.75,
      "text": "That's the examination finished."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 249.73,
      "end_seconds": 279.9,
      "duration_seconds": 30.17,
      "text": "Okay, so my impression is this: I think we're dealing with coeliac disease on a gluten-free diet with some accidental exposure at this stage. We shouldn't forget iron deficiency. I think a blood count makes sense here, for coeliac follow-up. I want coeliac antibodies done, that's for coeliac follow-up. That will help us see what's going on underneath and decide the next step."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 281.38,
      "end_seconds": 282.48,
      "duration_seconds": 1.1,
      "text": "Right, understood."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 283.92,
      "end_seconds": 300.01,
      "duration_seconds": 16.09,
      "text": "Check labels carefully and use separate toasters and chopping boards. I'd like you to see the dietitian as well, and I'll write the referral. Please don't wait if the symptoms get worse. That's when to be seen urgently."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 301.51,
      "end_seconds": 303.15,
      "duration_seconds": 1.64,
      "text": "I'll remember that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 303.9,
      "end_seconds": 311.34,
      "duration_seconds": 7.44,
      "text": "Let's review you in twelve months. Right, I think we're done unless you have questions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 313.38,
      "end_seconds": 318.29,
      "duration_seconds": 4.91,
      "text": "Mm, um, great, thank you for your help."
    }
  ]
